.TH WERKMEISTER-WAIT-LOAD 1 "" "werkmeister" "Werkmeister Manual"
.SH NAME
werkmeister\-wait\-load \- Wait, up to 30 min, while host load is above budget.host_load; with\-temp\-home runs it first
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwerkmeister wait\-load\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Waits while the host's 1\-minute load is above \fBbudget.host_load\fR in \fB~/.werkmeister/config.yaml\fR (default: 2 × CPUs; \fB0\fR turns it off), for up to 30 minutes, then returns and says so: the same wait \fBpr gate\fR and \fBpr open\fR run before each check. \fB.werkmeister/bin/with\-temp\-home\fR runs it before its command; \fBWERKMEISTER_NO_WAIT=1\fR makes the wrapper skip it.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBwerkmeister\fR(1)
